                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "An interesting story told in an interesting way that unfortunately is just not fun. The main loop of finding data entries and showing them to the ai companions to slowly progress and add more entries is not a bad idea, but really requires a greater focus on putting pieces together to get new entries otherwise your just spamming \"Show Message\" on everything you see the first time until you get to the ending. A boring and linear process. Despite being not being fun being a pretty big criticism I think it would still be worthwhile to try out for the genuinely interesting world building and novel form of storytelling. But there is one decision with how the game progresses near the end that i think fundamentally devalues a lot of the themes in the game *SLIGHT SPOILERS* by having a romance subplot be introduced near the end of the game.",
